msgctxt "92"
msgid "Shit... This guy really eats his spinach, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"So, you ready to talk now? Tell me about this \"brat\" you\r\n"
"mentioned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Urgh..."
msgstr "Urgh..."

msgctxt "128"
msgid "You listenin', punk!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Open your mouth or I'll open it for you! Now did you kidnap\r\n"
"Saki or not? Huh!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Look, we didn't take nobody! Some bitch claimin' to be\r\n"
"the girl's mother brought her in!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "What could her mom possibly have to do with the Tamashiro...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Duh, the tramp's sleepin' with the boss! Probably doesn't\r\n"
"realize she's just another notch on the bedpost for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"In other words, you have no reason to keep Saki. Give her\r\n"
"back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"Look, we don't have her in a cage or nothin'! She and her\r\n"
"mom could be anywhere!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"Hm, I think there's more to this than you're letting on.\r\n"
"Maybe we should go pay your boss a little visit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "Rikiya. Where's the Tamashiro office?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Are you outta your mind, Aniki!? We can't go in there just\r\n"
"the two of us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"Heh, your boy's right. They're gonna tear you limb from limb\r\n"
"in there... but if you really wanna die, I'll tell you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"It's on the street <Color:7>behind the convenience store<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "You heard the man, Rikiya. Come on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "But Aniki..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "You there! In the kitschy shirt!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr "Mh?"

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Oh shit..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "Chi sei?"

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Me? Who the fuck are you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"Don't tell me you didn't know you're waddling all over\r\n"
"Tamashiro Family territory right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"Tamashiro? Sorry, never heard of 'em. I usually try to keep\r\n"
"my nose out of yakuza business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"Bullshit! It's clear as the damn Okinawa sky what you do for\r\n"
"a living!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"I'm telling the truth. And even if I was a yakuza, I'm not\r\n"
"here looking for trouble. Now I suggest you leave us alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Or else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"Wait, is that Rikiya back there? Your little game of hide\r\n"
"and seek's not gonna work on me, Ryudo asshole!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Aw, shit..."
msgstr "Ah, merda..."

msgctxt "464"
msgid "I knew it!"
msgstr "Lo sapevo!"

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"Not yakuza, my ass! If you weren't yakuza, you wouldn't\r\n"
"be spendin' your time with this Ryudo sap! You here to try\r\n"
"and take the brat back!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "Hm? What brat?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "I don't got time for the twenty questions, bitch!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "C'mon boys, let's show them what we do to trespassers!"
msgstr ""

